From: William Emerison Six <billsix@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 23:56:42 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2892/3799] soh: rename func_80B3E87C -> EnXc_SetHarpLimbDList

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: swaps in gSheikHarpDL once the animation passes frame 34
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Xc/z_en_xc.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Xc/z_en_xc.c | 5 +++--
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Xc/z_en_xc.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Xc/z_en_xc.c
index 425444b1f..fa444b9e3 100644
--- a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Xc/z_en_xc.c
+++ b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Xc/z_en_xc.c
@@ -1106,7 +1106,8 @@ void EnXc_Fade(EnXc* this, PlayState* play) {
     EnXc_InitFlame(this, play);
 }
 
-void func_80B3E87C(Gfx** dList, EnXc* this) {
+// LLM generated name (HIGH), was func_80B3E87C: swaps in gSheikHarpDL once the animation passes frame 34
+void EnXc_SetHarpLimbDList(Gfx** dList, EnXc* this) {
     f32 currentFrame = this->skelAnime.curFrame;
 
     if (currentFrame >= 34.0f) {
@@ -1119,7 +1120,7 @@ s32 EnXc_PullingOutHarpOverrideLimbDraw(PlayState* play, s32 limbIndex, Gfx** dL
     EnXc* this = (EnXc*)thisx;
 
     if (limbIndex == 12) {
-        func_80B3E87C(dList, this);
+        EnXc_SetHarpLimbDList(dList, this);  // was func_80B3E87C [LLM:HIGH]
     }
 
     return 0;
